# Implementation Plan: Real-Time Swarm Telemetry Sync

The objective is to decouple the Sovereign UI from simulated/fallback values and ensure 100% fidelity with the physical swarm executor. This includes dynamic swarm discovery (10+ swarms) and real-time log streaming from the backend.

## Proposed Changes

---

### [Telemetry Server]

#### [MODIFY] [swarm_telemetry_server.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/swarm_telemetry_server.ts)

- Implement a **Log Tailer**: Use `fs.watch` or a polling mechanism to read `data/logs/executor.log`.
- Emit `telemetry` events: Broadcast new log lines to all connected Socket.IO clients.
- Ensure `swarm_update` sends the full 10-swarm registry gathered from [real_swarm_executor.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/scripts/real_swarm_executor.ts).

---

### [UI Data Layer]

#### [MODIFY] [realDataService.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/sovereign-ui/src/realDataService.ts)

- Update [getRealTimeData](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/sovereign-ui/src/realDataService.ts#144-153) to stop returning [getDefaultSwarms()](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/sovereign-ui/src/realDataService.ts#154-226) once real data has been received.
- Add a Log Subscriber: Handle the `telemetry` event and pipe it to the UI callback.

---

### [UI Dashboard]

#### [MODIFY] [App.tsx](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/sovereign-ui/src/App.tsx)

- **Fix Swarm Update Logic**: Update the `setSwarms` reducer to handle dynamic arrays (don't map over `prev` size).
- **Log Feed Integration**: Ensure the "COGNITIVE FEED" scrolls and displays the real-time stream from the telemetry server.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npx tsx scripts/swarm_telemetry_server.ts` and verify log lines appear in the console.
- Mock a socket event and verify the UI state updates for 10 swarms.

### Manual Verification
- Open [localhost:5174](http://localhost:5174).
- Confirm the "COGNITIVE FEED" shows live logs from the executor.
- Confirm all 10 swarms listed in the registry are visible and togglable.
